flowchart TD
  A[quota-axi starts] --> B[read declared sources in the background]
  A --> C[discover local lanes]
  C --> D{declared entry standsFor this lane,<br/>or same verified subscription hash?}
  D -- no --> L[read the lane locally]
  D -- yes --> E{shared reading fresh<br/>within the source maxAge?}
  E -- no: missing, failed, stale --> L
  E -- yes --> S[serve the lane from the shared reading<br/>no vendor call, marked sharedFrom]
